---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import QuoteForm from '../components/QuoteForm.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="For Parks | FenceCraft" description="Park and grounds maintenance, static-caravan painting, fencing, decking and groundworks from FenceCraft.">
  <section class="section sage"><div class="wrap split"><div><p class="eyebrow">FOR PARK MANAGERS &amp; PARK-HOME OWNERS</p><h1>Your park. Taken care of.</h1><p class="intro">From one-off improvements to ongoing upkeep. Practical experience across the grounds and beyond.</p><a class="btn" href="/request-a-quote/?project=park">Discuss your park’s needs ↗</a></div><img src="/assets/park-1200.webp" width="1800" height="1200" fetchpriority="high" alt="Illustrative park home with decking and glass balustrades" /></div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">A WIDER VIEW OF THE WORK</p><h2>From the footings to the finishing touch.</h2></div><p class="muted">Tell us about the site, the approximate scope and the timing. We can start with the work that needs doing now.</p></div><div class="services-six"><a href="/services/park-maintenance/"><h3>Park &amp; grounds maintenance ↗</h3><p>Practical upkeep for park spaces, from one-off jobs to ongoing needs.</p></a><a href="/services/caravan-painting/"><h3>Static-caravan exterior painting ↗</h3><p>A fresh, practical finish for static caravans and park settings.</p></a><a href="/services/footings-groundworks/"><h3>Footings &amp; groundworks ↗</h3><p>Ground preparation and footing works, with scope agreed for your site.</p></a><a href="/services/decking/"><h3>Decking ↗</h3><p>Timber or composite spaces for park homes and shared areas.</p></a><a href="/services/glass-fencing/"><h3>Glass fencing &amp; balustrades ↗</h3><p>Clear edges for raised decks and outdoor areas.</p></a><a href="/services/garden-fencing/"><h3>Fencing &amp; repairs ↗</h3><p>Boundaries and practical repairs across the site.</p></a></div></div></section>
  <section class="section sage"><div class="wrap split"><div><p class="eyebrow">A TRACK RECORD TO DESCRIBE ACCURATELY</p><h2>Practical park experience, built over time.</h2><p class="heritage-quote">“Over 20 years carrying out work for Wyldecrest Parks in Wrexham and Flintshire.”</p><p class="muted">This is a description of work history, not an endorsement, exclusivity or approved-contractor status. No Wyldecrest logo is used here.</p></div><div class="callout"><strong>For a park enquiry</strong><p>Include the site location, approximate scope and preferred timing. That gives us the most useful starting point.</p><a class="text-link" href="/request-a-quote/?project=park">Start a park enquiry ↗</a></div></div></section>
  <section class="section white"><div class="wrap quote-layout"><div><p class="eyebrow">PARK ENQUIRIES</p><h2>Start with the site details.</h2><p class="muted">The form is a clearly labelled preview until a real enquiry endpoint is configured.</p><div class="side-contact"><a href="tel:+447935190681">07935 190681</a><a href="mailto:info@fence-craft.co.uk">info@fence-craft.co.uk</a></div></div><QuoteForm park={true} /></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
